{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxanalytics\/analyticsservice"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsService\/alias(newID:previousID:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsService\/flush()","doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsService\/identify(userID:properties:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsService\/reset()","doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsService\/track(_:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AnalyticsService"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","title":"AnalyticsService","externalID":"s:15SwiduxAnalytics0B7ServiceP","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxAnalytics"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AnalyticsService"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AnalyticsService"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementations handle their own batching, retry, network failure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and offline queueing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dispatch doesn’t wait for these calls, but the plugin serializes them:"}